<title>UK: Beta Finance sets 300 mln mark 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Beta Finance sets 300 mln mark 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BETA FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    05.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.08    PAY DATE    05.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.33     SPREAD	+28 BP</p>
